# RFC 4180 specifies CRLF, and a test asserts the committed export matches byte for byte. Without
# this, git's end-of-line normalization rewrites the file on checkout on some platforms and the
# assertion fails for a reason that has nothing to do with the data.
data/dataset.csv -text

# The IPEDS archives are inputs a test replays byte for byte. Marked binary explicitly rather than
# left to git's content sniffing, because a zip that gets end-of-line normalized on any platform
# stops being the file NCES published and the replay fails for a reason unrelated to the data.
data/HD*.zip binary
data/IC*.zip binary
